  "custom_logic_notes": "Night/flat range breakout strategy: identifies a narrow 3-bar range (between DiffMin and DiffMax pips) during a 2-hour window (InpOpenHour to InpOpenHour+1). Long entry when price is in the bottom quarter of the range (above lowest but below lowest+diff/4). Short entry when price is in the top quarter of the range (below highest but above highest-diff/4). SL is set at 1/3 of the range beyond the range extreme. Symbol is hardcoded to EURUSD and timeframe to H1 - EA fails OnInit if either doesn't match. Free margin must be >= 100. iHighest/iLowest are custom reimplementation functions using CopyHigh/CopyLow, not the deprecated MQL4 builtins.",
